#: ../../source/algorithms.rst:2
msgid "Federated learning algorithms"
msgstr "联邦学习算法"

#: ../../source/algorithms.rst:4
msgid ""
"Federated optimization algorithms have been the central problem in the field"
" of federated learning since its inception. This chapter contains a "
"collection of algorithms that have been proposed in the literature, which "
"will be analyzed from the viewpoint of optimization theory, espcially the "
"theory of operator splitting."
msgstr ""
"联邦优化算法自从联邦学习这一概念诞生起，便一直是相关研究的中心问题之一。本章汇集了文献中提出的一系列算法，并将从优化理论的视角、尤其是算子分裂理论的角度对它们进行分析。"
